{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0211-design-add-search-words","title":"LeetCode 211 添加与搜索单词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0211-design-add-search-words","wordCount":886,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-211-添加与搜索单词\">LeetCode 211 添加与搜索单词</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>请你设计一个数据结构，支持添加新单词和查找字符串是否与任何先前添加的字符串匹配。</p>\n<p>实现词典类 <code>WordDictionary</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>WordDictionary()</code> 初始化词典对象</li>\n<li><code>void addWord(word)</code> 将 <code>word</code> 添加到数据结构中，之后可以对它进行匹配</li>\n<li><code>bool search(word)</code> 如果数据结构中存在字符串与 <code>word</code> 匹配，则返回 <code>true</code>；否则返回 <code>false</code>。<code>word</code> 中可能包含一些 <code>&#39;.&#39;</code>，每个 <code>.</code> 都可以表示任何一个字母</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= word.length &lt;= 25</code></li>\n<li><code>addWord</code> 中的 <code>word</code> 由小写英文字母组成</li>\n<li><code>search</code> 中的 <code>word</code> 由 <code>&#39;.&#39;</code> 或小写英文字母组成</li>\n<li>最多调用 <code>10^4</code> 次 <code>addWord</code> 和 <code>search</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：&#10;[&quot;WordDictionary&quot;,&quot;addWord&quot;,&quot;addWord&quot;,&quot;addWord&quot;,&quot;search&quot;,&quot;search&quot;,&quot;search&quot;,&quot;search&quot;]&#10;[[],[&quot;bad&quot;],[&quot;dad&quot;],[&quot;mad&quot;],[&quot;pad&quot;],[&quot;bad&quot;],[&quot;.ad&quot;],[&quot;b..&quot;]]&#10;输出：[null,null,null,null,false,true,true,true]&#10;&#10;解释：&#10;WordDictionary wd = new WordDictionary();&#10;wd.addWord(&quot;bad&quot;);&#10;wd.addWord(&quot;dad&quot;);&#10;wd.addWord(&quot;mad&quot;);&#10;wd.search(&quot;pad&quot;); // 返回 false&#10;wd.search(&quot;bad&quot;); // 返回 true&#10;wd.search(&quot;.ad&quot;); // 返回 true（匹配 bad, dad, mad）&#10;wd.search(&quot;b..&quot;); // 返回 true（匹配 bad）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\"WordDictionary\",\"addWord\",\"addWord\",\"addWord\",\"search\",\"search\",\"search\",\"search\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[],[\"bad\"],[\"dad\"],[\"mad\"],[\"pad\"],[\"bad\"],[\".ad\"],[\"b..\"]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[null,null,null,null,false,true,true,true]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WordDictionary wd = new WordDictionary();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.addWord(\"bad\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.addWord(\"dad\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.addWord(\"mad\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.search(\"pad\"); // 返回 false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.search(\"bad\"); // 返回 true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.search(\".ad\"); // 返回 true（匹配 bad, dad, mad）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wd.search(\"b..\"); // 返回 true（匹配 bad）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题是 LC 208 的进阶版，在标准 Trie 的基础上增加了通配符 <code>.</code> 的支持，需要结合 DFS 进行搜索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>addWord 操作</strong></p>\n<p>与标准 Trie 的 <code>insert</code> 完全相同——逐字符创建节点路径，最后标记 <code>isEnd</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>search 操作（含通配符）</strong></p>\n<p>当遇到普通字符时，直接走对应的子节点。当遇到 <code>.</code> 时，需要尝试所有可能的子节点——这就引入了回溯/DFS。</p>\n<p>具体策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果当前字符是普通字母，检查对应子节点是否存在，存在则递归搜索</li>\n<li>如果当前字符是 <code>.</code>，遍历当前节点的所有子节点，任何一条路径匹配成功即返回 <code>true</code></li>\n<li>递归到字符串末尾时，检查当前节点的 <code>isEnd</code></li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无通配符</td>\n<td>O(m)</td>\n<td>等同于标准 Trie 查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全是通配符 &quot;...&quot;</td>\n<td>O(26^m)</td>\n<td>最差情况，遍历所有路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合 &quot;a.b&quot;</td>\n<td>O(26^d × m)</td>\n<td>d 为通配符数量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际场景中通配符数量通常很少，性能远好于最差情况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class TrieNode {&#10;  children: Map&lt;string, TrieNode&gt;;&#10;  isEnd: boolean;&#10;&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    this.children = new Map();&#10;    this.isEnd = false;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class WordDictionary {&#10;  private root: TrieNode;&#10;&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    this.root = new TrieNode();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  addWord(word: string): void {&#10;    let node = this.root;&#10;    for (const ch of word) {&#10;      if (!node.children.has(ch)) {&#10;        node.children.set(ch, new TrieNode());&#10;      }&#10;      node = node.children.get(ch)!;&#10;    }&#10;    node.isEnd = true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  search(word: string): boolean {&#10;    return this.dfs(word, 0, this.root);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private dfs(word: string, index: number, node: TrieNode): boolean {&#10;    if (index === word.length) {&#10;      return node.isEnd;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const ch = word[index];&#10;&#10;    if (ch === &#39;.&#39;) {&#10;      for (const child of node.children.values()) {&#10;        if (this.dfs(word, index + 1, child)) {&#10;          return true;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (!node.children.has(ch)) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return this.dfs(word, index + 1, node.children.get(ch)!);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TrieNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TrieNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isEnd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.isEnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WordDictionary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: